# eUPF needs NET_ADMIN to attach XDP and configure routes, BPF and PERFMON
# to load eBPF programs, SYS_RESOURCE to raise RLIMIT_MEMLOCK, and NET_RAW
# for downlink buffering continuation. A restricted capability set cannot
# provide these operations.
AVD-KSV-0118

# NET_RAW opens the AF_PACKET raw socket in cmd/core/packet_sender_linux.go.
# Only downlink data buffering continuation uses it: rendered Ethernet frames
# go to the resolved output interface for XDP_TX/REDIRECT, or to the private
# eub* veth for XDP_PASS reinjection through its peer's TC ingress program.
AVD-KSV-0119
